				\begin{document}$$\begin{aligned} m_t = \max (log(f_t) + m_{t-1}, log(i_t)) . \end{aligned}$$\end{document}This exponential gating mechanism enables more dynamic information filtering, improving both information retention and forgetting processes across temporal dependencies. Second, xLSTM introduces matrix LSTM (mLSTM), which replaces traditional scalar memory cells \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
